{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a9e1d82f-5374-4bf8-b643-9821db60a821",
    "name": "Organic Store / FoodMiles Backend API",
    "description": "# Organic Store & FoodMiles Backend REST API Collection\n\nComprehensive, production-ready Postman collection for the Organic Store backend ecosystem with standard `{ success, message, data }` responses.\n\n### Features:\n- 🔐 **Automated Auth**: Login/Signup/Refresh auto-populates `accessToken`, `refreshToken`, and user IDs.\n- 📦 **Dynamic Variables**: Endpoints share IDs (`productId`, `orderId`, `userEmail`, etc.) dynamically across requests.\n- 🧪 **Built-in Test Scripts**: Every request validates HTTP status codes, response structure (`success`, `message`, `data`), and payload integrity.\n- ⚙️ **Environment Aware**: Configured to seamlessly switch between Localhost (`http://localhost:4000`), Staging, and Production.\n\n### Recommended Execution Flow:\n1. **User APIs** -> *User Signup* or *User Login* (auto-sets `accessToken` and `userId`).\n2. **Product APIs** -> *Create New Product* (auto-sets `productId`).\n3. **Order APIs** -> *Create New Order* (auto-sets `orderId`).\n4. **Payment APIs** -> *Create Payment Intent* -> *Update Order After Payment* / *Webhook*.\n5. **Speech / Recipe / Testimonials** for auxiliary workflows.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
